rt-brain-surgery-technology-comes-akuh"}, {"title": "Aga Khan University Hospital becomes the first to introduce advanced equipment for brain surgeries in Pakistan", "url": "https://ismailimail.blog/2016/04/11/aga-khan-university-hospital-becomes-the-first-to-introduce-advanced-equipment-for-brain-surgeries-in-pakistan"}, {"title": "tehqeeqat.org", "url": "https://tehqeeqat.org/downloadpdf/19268"}, {"title": "mous to introduce advanced robotic surgery", "url": "https://hospitals.aku.edu/pakistan/AboutUs/News/Pages/mous-to-introduce-advanced-robotic-surgery.aspx"}, {"title": "AKDN / Gary Otte", "url": "https://the.akdn/en/resources-media/whats-new/in-the-media/akuh-introduces-robotic-positioning-system-brain-surgery-pakistan"}, {"title": "Aga Khan University Hospital", "url": "https://about.me/agakhan"}]}, "The search points to **2016** as the year AKUH introduced the Neuro-Robotic Exoscope in Pakistan, though I didn't find the Express Tribune article itself.\n\n- **Date:** An April 11, 2016 Karachi announcement says the Aga Khan University Hospital has become the first to introduce new extraordinarily advanced brain surgery technology to Pakistan, and that it is the only hospital outside North America with this equipment.\n- **Express Tribune link:** An AKDN media summary credits The Express Tribune, dated 11 September 2017, with a piece on the system. It says that in April 2016, the Aga Khan University Karachi (Pakistan) (AKUH) acquired a neurorobotics exoscope and neuronavigation system. This is a 2017 article about a 2016 acquisition, so the 2017 date is the article's publication date, not the introduction date.\n- **Wording:** The phrasing in your query appears on an About.me page for the hospital, which says the hospital has become the first medical center to introduce the new advanced brain surgery technology, Neuro-Robotic Exoscope, in Pakistan. That page doesn't give a date.\n- **Hospital's own page:** AKUH says it was the first outside of North America to introduce an organized system approach for Awake Craniotomy using the exoscope.\n\nBased on these results, the answer is 2016. The Express Tribune article is the likely original source, but I couldn't retrieve it to confirm its wording."], "durationSeconds": 6.829204749999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01MhKFaznN4ESnBJrwRFUAFg", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
