"hub.harborframework.com", "url": "https://hub.harborframework.com/tasks/openai/829"}, {"title": "​Section of Neurosurgery", "url": "https://hospitals.aku.edu/pakistan/Health-Services/department-of-surgery/section-of-neurosurgery/Pages/default.aspx"}, {"title": "Article Author: State-of-the-art brain surgery technology comes to AKUH", "url": "https://the.akdn/en/resources-media/whats-new/in-the-media/state-art-brain-surgery-technology-comes-akuh"}, {"title": "tehqeeqat.org", "url": "https://tehqeeqat.org/downloadpdf/19268"}, {"title": "AKDN / Gary Otte", "url": "https://the.akdn/en/resources-media/whats-new/in-the-media/akuh-introduces-robotic-positioning-system-brain-surgery-pakistan"}, {"title": "exoscopic robotic visualization", "url": "https://advancedneuro.endeavorhealth.org/innovative-treatments/exoscopic-robotic-visualization/"}, {"title": "Monday, Aug 10, 2026", "url": "https://telanganatoday.com/aig-hospitals-performs-complex-skull-to-spine-tumour-surgery-using-ar-mr-robotic-exoscope"}]}, "I didn't find the Tribune article itself, so I can't confirm its exact wording. The results point to 2016 and 2017 for the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) exoscope.\n\n- **Acquisition:** An AKDN reprint of an Express Tribune piece dated 11 September 2017 says AKUH bought the neurorobotics exoscope and neuronavigation system in April 2016 (In April 2016, the Aga Khan University Karachi (Pakistan) (AKUH) acquired a neurorobotics exoscope and neuronavigation system). The same reprint says over 250 operations have been performed since installation.\n- **\"First\" claim:** AKUH's own news page says it is the first Teaching Hospital outside North America and the first in Pakistan to introduce the revolutionary \"Neuro-Robotic Exoscope\". Its neurosurgery section repeats that it was the first outside of North America to introduce an organized system approach for Awake Craniotomy, using the exoscope.\n- **Date of the AKUH news item:** The AKU page shows no date in the results, so I can't date it from there.\n- **Benchmark page:** One result (hub.harborframework.com) is a question asking for the year the Express Tribune reported the \"first medical center\" line. It is a quiz prompt, not a source, so I didn't rely on it.\n\nThe best-supported answer to \"what year\" is 2017 for the Express Tribune report, with the acquisition in April 2016. Checking the Tribune's archive directly would confirm the publication date."], "durationSeconds": 7.316999041000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01351xBQd1cA93fRGVfu5mHr", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
