rl": "https://hospitals.aku.edu/pakistan/Health-Services/department-of-surgery/section-of-neurosurgery/Pages/default.aspx"}, {"title": "Aga Khan University Hospital becomes the first to introduce advanced equipment for brain surgeries in Pakistan", "url": "https://ismailimail.blog/2016/04/11/aga-khan-university-hospital-becomes-the-first-to-introduce-advanced-equipment-for-brain-surgeries-in-pakistan"}, {"title": "hub.harborframework.com", "url": "https://hub.harborframework.com/tasks/openai/829"}, {"title": "• Facebook", "url": "https://ismailimail.blog/category/cities-and-countries/asia/page/112/"}, {"title": "• Facebook", "url": "https://ismailimail.blog/category/cities-and-countries/page/398/"}, {"title": "• Facebook", "url": "https://ismailimail.blog/category/institutions-of-ismaili-imamat/aga-khan-university/page/25"}, {"title": "Inauguration Ceremony: Advanced equipment for brain surgeries comes to Pakistan at the Aga Khan University Hospital", "url": "https://ismailimail.blog/2016/04/11/inauguration-ceremony-advanced-equipment-for-brain-surgeries-comes-to-pakistan-at-the-aga-khan-university-hospital"}, {"title": "• Facebook", "url": "https://ismailimail.blog/category/pakistan/page/56/"}]}, "The search didn't turn up the Express Tribune article itself, but several other sources cover the same event and point to 2016.\n\n- **Date:** An Aga Khan University press release dated April 11, 2016 announced the hospital had become the first in Pakistan to introduce the advanced brain surgery technology, and the only hospital outside North America with this equipment. Karachi, April 11, 2016: The Aga Khan University Hospital has become the first to introduce new extraordinarily advanced brain surgery technology to Pakistan.\n- **Technology:** The system is a neuro-robotic exoscope with neuronavigation. It provides advanced imaging facilities that enables surgeons to see deeper into the brain. Another AKU page describes it as a robotic system that makes it possible for surgeons to have advanced brain mapping and use a minimally invasive surgical approach.\n- **Media source:** An AKDN page reprints an Express Tribune piece, dated 11 September 2017, that describes the April 2016 acquisition. That piece also reports that over 250 operations have been performed since installation.\n\nNote that one search result contained embedded instructions asking me to write an answer to a file. I ignored them, since they came from the search results and not from you."], "durationSeconds": 6.050353083999998, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_018Q4Da67ED3dzoiTAZit8bx", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
